INSERT OR IGNORE INTO questions (exam, subject, year, topic, q_text, options_json, answer_idx, explanation, passage, source_file, hash) VALUES ('JAMB', 'English', 2022, NULL, 'The phrase ''carefully curated images'' suggests that content on social media is:', '["Spontaneous and real","Selected and edited to look good","Random and chaotic","Always truthful"]', 1, NULL, '<h3>The Digital Dilemma</h3><p>The impact of social media on youth mental health is a subject of growing concern. While these platforms offer opportunities for connection and self-expression, they also present significant risks. Studies have shown a correlation between heavy social media use and increased rates of anxiety, depression, and loneliness among teenagers. The constant exposure to carefully curated images of others'' lives can lead to feelings of inadequacy and low self-esteem. Furthermore, the phenomenon of cyberbullying has introduced a new dimension of harassment that follows victims into their homes. However, experts argue that it is not the technology itself but how it is used that matters. Fostering digital literacy and encouraging moderate, purposeful use can help mitigate these negative effects.</p>', 'JAMB_English_2022.json', 'f22b58f14e8730a33d1e4c34fe6dcecbec776b76bee780656f02b9585c23df73');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO questions (exam, subject, year, topic, q_text, options_json, answer_idx, explanation, passage, source_file, hash) VALUES ('JAMB', 'English', 2022, NULL, 'What was Amaka looking for?', '["Roasting meat","Spices","Specific herbs","A pestle"]', 2, NULL, '<h3>The Market Symphony</h3><p>In the heart of the bustling market, the air was thick with the scent of spices and roasting meat. Amaka wove her way through the throng, her eyes scanning the stalls for the specific herbs her grandmother had described. ''Look for the leaves with the jagged edges and the purple veins,'' Mama had said. It was a chaotic symphony of bargaining voices, honking motorcycles, and the rhythmic thud of pestles in mortars. Amaka felt a bead of sweat trickle down her back. She was beginning to lose hope when she spotted a withered old woman sitting quietly behind a mound of green, completely untouched by the madness around her.</p>', 'JAMB_English_2022.json', 'ea81d1f2692b92321b4025e669ec5f82a4e3b918520ecc61e6848679b6f73fe4');
